We have, for the covariants and contravariants of the cubic following Table No.~69:
\begin{align*}
\Theta(\alpha U + 6\beta HU) &= \Theta\alpha PU + \Theta\beta QU,\\
H(\Theta\alpha PU + \Theta\beta QU) &= (-2T, 48S^2, 18TS, T^2 + 16S^3 \, \wr\, \alpha, \beta)^2 PU\\
